<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Brooks starts as outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Brooks starts as outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it initiated coverage of Brooks Fiber Properties Inc with an outperform rating for the intermediate and long term.</p>
<p>--Its 18-month price target on the stock is $43.</p>
<p>--Brooks Fiber was trading at 28-1/8, up 1/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
